.MAX3267CSA-plus- :1 ;The MAX3266 is a transimpedance preamplifier for 1.25Gbps local area network (LAN) fiber optic receivers. The circuit features 200nA input-referred noise, 920MHz bandwidth, and 1mA input overload.
